msgid "Hub RPC"
msgstr "Hub RPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Hub RPC** (`HubRPC/1.0`) is the **single business channel** between Hub clients and the agent runtime. Transport:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:11
msgid ""
"**WebSocket** — long-lived connection at **`/hub/rpc/v1`** (connect "
"handshake + heartbeat; HubRPC `req`/`res`/`evt` envelope)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:11
msgid ""
"**HTTP REST** — stateless GET/POST at **`/hub/rpc/v1/{method/path}`** (plain "
"JSON body or query; `Authorization: Bearer`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:13
msgid ""
"Implemented in [`src/shared/hub-rpc/`](../../src/shared/hub-rpc/) (WS "
"envelope + HTTP REST helpers) and [`src/platform/hub/http-rest-router.ts`]"
"(../../src/platform/hub/http-rest-router.ts) (HTTP adapter)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:15
msgid ""
"Binary HTTP methods (e.g. `tts.synthesize`, companion assets, TLS PEM/QR) "
"use Hub RPC REST with registry `request` / `response` encoding. Public "
"probes (`health.probe`, `tls.ca.*`) are Hub RPC methods with `auth: "
"optional` — `GET /hub/rpc/v1/health/probe`, `GET /hub/rpc/v1/tls/ca`, etc."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:17
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "SAP (`SAP/1.0`) is a **session layer** on top of Hub RPC: true satellites "
#| "call `sap.attach` after connect; bundled SPA modules **never** attach."
msgid ""
"SAP (`SAP/1.0`) is a **session layer** on top of Hub RPC WebSocket: true "
"satellites call `sap.attach` after connect; bundled SPA modules **never** "
"attach."
msgstr ""
"SAP（`SAP/1.0`）是 Hub RPC 之上的**会话层**：真正的卫星在 connect 后调用 "
"`sap.attach`；壳内 bundled SPA 模块**从不** attach。"

