msgid "HTTP REST mapping"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:33
msgid ""
"Hub method `domain.action` maps to path **`/hub/rpc/v1/domain/action`** "
"(dots → slashes; camelCase preserved)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Kind           | HTTP     | Example                                                             |\n"
"| -------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Read-only      | **GET**  | `GET /hub/rpc/v1/task/list?subject_kind=user`                       |\n"
"| Write          | **POST** | `POST /hub/rpc/v1/task/create` `{ subject_kind, title, … }`         |\n"
"| By id (read)   | **GET**  | `GET /hub/rpc/v1/task/get/42?subject_kind=user`                     |\n"
"| By id (write)  | **POST** | `POST /hub/rpc/v1/task/patch/42` `{ subject_kind, title?, … }`      |\n"
"| Sensitive read | **POST** | `POST /hub/rpc/v1/vault/get/3` `{ subject_kind, include_secrets? }` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:43
msgid ""
"Route metadata is generated from [`hub-contract`](../../src/shared/hub-"
"contract/) (`meta.http`: `verb`, `path`, `pathParams`). Wrong verb on a "
"known path → **405**; legacy `POST /hub/rpc/v1` envelope → **410**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:45
msgid ""
"HTTP responses are **plain handler JSON** (not HubRPC `res` envelope). "
"Errors: `{ \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\" } }` with 4xx/5xx status."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:46
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Envelope kinds"
msgid "WebSocket envelope kinds"
msgstr "信封类型"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:55
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| `kind`      | Direction    | Purpose                                           |\n"
#| "| ----------- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| `connect`   | Client → Hub | First frame; `protocol: HubRPC/1.0`, `auth_token` |\n"
#| "| `connected` | Hub → Client | `session_id`, `heartbeat_interval_sec`            |\n"
#| "| `req`       | Client → Hub | RPC (`id`, `method`, `payload`)                   |\n"
#| "| `res`       | Hub → Client | RPC reply                                         |\n"
#| "| `evt`       | Both         | Async event (incl. `heartbeat`)                   |\n"
msgid ""
"| `kind`      | Direction    | Purpose                                                    |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `connect`   | Client → Hub | WS only: first frame; `protocol: HubRPC/1.0`, `auth_token` |\n"
"| `connected` | Hub → Client | WS only: `session_id`, `heartbeat_interval_sec`            |\n"
"| `req`       | Client → Hub | RPC (`id`, `method`, `payload`)                            |\n"
"| `res`       | Hub → Client | RPC reply                                                  |\n"
"| `evt`       | Both         | Async event (WS only; incl. `heartbeat`)                   |\n"
msgstr ""
"| `kind`      | 方向         | 用途                                              |\n"
"| ----------- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `connect`   | Client → Hub | 首帧；`protocol: HubRPC/1.0`、`auth_token`        |\n"
"| `connected` | Hub → Client | `session_id`、`heartbeat_interval_sec`            |\n"
"| `req`       | Client → Hub | RPC（`id`、`method`、`payload`）                  |\n"
"| `res`       | Hub → Client | RPC 回复                                          |\n"
"| `evt`       | 双向         | 异步事件（含 `heartbeat`）                        |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:57
msgid ""
"HTTP REST uses Bearer on each GET/POST unless the method declares `auth: "
"optional` (e.g. `health.probe`, `tls.ca.*`). WebSocket uses `connect` frame "
"`auth_token` (required)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:59
msgid ""
"Method contracts live in [`src/shared/hub-contract/registry/`](../../src/"
"shared/hub-contract/registry/) (`transports: http | ws`; HTTP routes in "
"`meta.http`). Handlers register via `feature/plugin.hub.rpc`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:63
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Every connection must send a valid **service API token** in the `connect` "
#| "payload (`auth_token`). The Hub verifies it with `verifyServiceApiToken` "
#| "([`core/src/db/pg/service-api-token/`](../../core/src/db/pg/service-api-"
#| "token/))."
msgid ""
"Every **WebSocket** connection must send a valid **service API token** in "
"the `connect` payload (`auth_token`). **HTTP REST** uses `Authorization: "
"Bearer fa_at_...` on each request unless the method registry marks `auth: "
"optional` (public read-only probes only). The Hub verifies with "
"`verifyServiceApiToken` ([`src/core/db/pg/service-api-token/`](../../src/"
"core/db/pg/service-api-token/))."
msgstr ""
"每次连接必须在 `connect` 载荷（`auth_token`）中发送有效的**服务 API 令牌**。"
"Hub 通过 `verifyServiceApiToken` 验证（[`core/src/db/pg/service-api-token/`]"
"(../../core/src/db/pg/service-api-token/)）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:65
msgid ""
"Bundled clients read the token from `window.satelliteShell.remoteAuth.token` "
"(shell bridge), configured in client **Hub settings** (`/setup` or settings "
"panel). Hub `/web/config.json` does not include tokens."
msgstr ""

