#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/hub-rpc.md:75
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Capability        | Description                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
